      "content": "it's just hard to believe in \"forever\" light when the darkness feels so much more real. it's not even that it hurts anymore, it just feels inevitable. like, if the rooms are just going to be empty and dark anyway, why keep trying to keep the candles lit? it's just so exhausting to fight the shadows.",
